# Export declaration targets for functions defined under ColliderBit.
#
# Glean's C++ schema calls this relation DeclarationTargets. It is richer than
# a pure function-call relation because a declaration may refer to records,
# variables, namespaces, or functions. The renderer filters the result to
# declarations that have a source file under the selected GAMBIT prefixes.

T where
  cxx.DeclarationTargets T;
  T.source.function_?.source.file = "ColliderBit/"..
